  sentences:
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Archer.
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
    text: Me? Really?
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Not because you deserve it yet. Because I want to see if you can earn it.
      Honesty, or nothing. I won't pretend a second time.
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
    text: 'Honesty. Starting right now: I''m really, really scared you''ll change
      your mind.'
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Good. Stay scared.
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: Across the park, Liam watches the two of you for a moment, then slips his
      sketchbook under his arm and smiles his small, quiet smile. He leaves without
      a word.
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: It won't be easy. Archer will have to prove himself every day. But when
      he reaches for your hand, you let him.
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'Ending: Second Chance'
    actions: []    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
